{"step_index":724,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T01:47:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T20:47:09-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T20:47:09-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`\nTotal Lines: 401\nTotal Bytes: 27080\nShowing lines 101 to 250\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n101: ```\n102: \n103: ---\n104: \n105: ## 3. Chapter 2: Paradise Lost (Port Gellhorn & Kelly County)\n106: \n107: ### Mechanics & Structure\n108: - **Playable Character**: Heavily centered on **Lucia** during early recovery, then **permanently unlocks Dual Character Switching** via *\"Coffee Break\"*.\n109: - **Vehicle Fencing**: Unlocked via *\"Moses\"* (enabling Slim Jim vehicle thefts and custom garage registrations).\n110: - **Strict Chronological Sequence**: Unlike Chapter 3, Chapter 2 is organized into **4 sequential stages** that must be cleared in order (M23 through M44).\n111:   - **Stage 1: Motel Arrival & Medical (M23–M28)**: Infiltration, paying upkeep, Lucia solo medical run, and establishing fencing with Moses.\n112:   - **Stage 2: Debt Hustle & Gun Runs (M29–M37)**: Disguise setups, ambulance chasing, painkiller supply lines, and corner meetups.\n113:   - **Stage 3: Dual Character Switching & Robberies (M38–M40)**: *Coffee Break* unlocks instant partner switching; *Hit Avery Pawn* introduces business robberies.\n114:   - **Stage 4: Highway Escape & Move to Vice City (M41–M44)**: Vehicle recovery, Kelly County smugglers, and the motel evacuation climax in *Checking Out*.\n115: \n116: ```mermaid\n117: flowchart TD\n118:     C1_Trans[\"From Ch. 1: Doin' Gone\"] --> S1_Start\n119:     \n120:     subgraph S1[\"Stage 1: Motel Arrival &