162: - **Safehouse Spine (M45–M50)**: Infiltration into the metropolis culminates in *South Leonida Real Estate*, opening the primary Vice City safehouse.\n163: - **The 3 Parallel Alliance Strands**: Upon unlocking the safehouse, three major syndicate storylines open concurrently:\n164:   1. **Strand 1: Tyrone (Street Muscle)**: Missions 51 & 52 (*Tyrone* $\\rightarrow$ *Here, Kitty Kitty*).\n165:   2. **Strand 2: Boobie Ike & Dre'Quan (Syndicate)**: Missions 54, 55, & 56 (*Top Billing* $\\rightarrow$ *Boobie Time* $\\rightarrow$ *First Impressions*).\n166:   3. **Strand 3: Raul Bautista & Randy (Cartel Logistics & Cars)**: Missions 53, 57, 58, 59, & 60 (*Car Service* $\\rightarrow$ *Caught Slipping* $\\rightarrow$ *Crosstown Traffic* $\\rightarrow$ *Credit Check* $\\rightarrow$ *Steal Zorrusso for Randy*).\n167: - **Convergence at Heist Scope Out (M61)**: All 3 strands converge into *Sinfrontera National Bank*.\n168: - **The 3 Concurrent Heist Preparation Tracks**: Scope out unlocks the heist planning board, distributing prep work into 3 simultaneous tracks:\n169:   - **Track 1: Safecracker Pipeline**: *62. Security Expert* (Nicole Park) $\\rightarrow$ *65. Safe Word* (Drill) $\\rightarrow$ *68. Cooties* (Disinfection).\n170:   - **Track 2: Explosives Pipeline**: *63. Company Property* (Charges) $\\rightarrow$ *66. Hidden Charges* (Cell Towers) $\\rightarrow$ *69. Bricked Up* (Armor Route).\n171:   - **Track 3: Codes & Van Pipeline**: *64. The Missing Link* (Monty Interrogation) $\\rightarrow$ *67. Ride or Die* (Armored Van).\n172: - **The Heist Finale (M70)**: *The Cartel Heist* ($10.5M Take). \n173: - **CRITICAL SPEEDRUN REQUIREMENT**: Runners **MUST retain at least $75,000 cash** in their BuckMe account to clear Abe Gonzalez's mandatory wire gate in Chapter 4!\n174: \n175: ```mermaid\n176: flowchart TD\n177:     C2_Trans[\"From Ch. 2: Checking Out\"] --> M45[\"45. Welcome to Vice City\"]\n178:     M45 --> M46[\"46. Dealer's Choice\"]\n179:     M46 --> M47[\"47. 